1. In these rules, unless there is anything repugnant in the subject or context, -
(a)
Page 4/26

Rules Under Tamil Nadu Medical Registration Act, 1914
"the Act" means the Tamil Nadu Medical Registration Act, 1914 (Tamil Nadu Act IV of 1914);
(b)
"Council" means the Tamil Nadu Medical Council constituted under the Act;
(c)
"Form" means a Form annexed to these rules;
(d)
"Government" means the Government of Tamil Nadu;
(e)
"Returning Officer" means the Surgeon-General with the Government of Tamil Nadu.
